VISUAL: 
AUDIO: 'haven\'t seen Dark, definitely see Dark. It\'s German, it\'s on Netflix. You will not regret it. Dark is amazing. So, the method that I like to utilize is we\'re just going to grab a random frame from Dark here. It\'s just go ahead and grab all of this'

[09:31] [scene:talk]
VISUAL: 
AUDIO: 'information. You can just screenshot it, really. Now, you can do this anywhere. I\'m just going to do this over on Flora because uh you know, just because of the canvas-based feature of all of this stuff, it makes it very easy for all of you guys to follow along with. But, you know, essentially we\'re just dropping'

[09:44] [scene:talk]
VISUAL: 
AUDIO: 'our um our image, our screenshot, into here, and then uh Flora does have a like, you know, a number of LLMs that you can you can pop in. Um so, I\'m using GPT 5.5 here. We just connect it in and just say, "Take the color information,'

[09:57] [scene:talk]
